<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Lonely in Tokyo"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="MIREI"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Take Me Away"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="QMFME1964046"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1491411574"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="176552149"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Zennmn"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>Mirei Toyama</songwriter><songwriter>ZACHARY ADAMS LEEVER</songwriter><songwriter>Samuel Morris Zornow</songwriter></songwriters><translations xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">独自漂泊在东京</text><text for="L2">霓虹照不亮前路</text><text for="L3">伸出手渴望一线希望</text><text for="L4">却无处可去</text><text for="L5">孤身一人在东京</text><text for="L6">黑西装们要花钱买爱</text><text for="L7">他们付出的永远不够</text><text for="L8">没有哪儿比得上家</text><text for="L9">每当我看见</text><text for="L10">桌上留下的五块钱</text><text for="L11">就知道妈妈又在外面喝得烂醉</text><text for="L12">一切都如此不安稳</text><text for="L13">当我走进</text><text for="L14">那家二十四小时便利店 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(便利店)</span></text><text for="L15">所有东西尝起来都像塑料 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(塑料)</span></text><text for="L16">我再也吃不下了</text><text for="L17">嘟嘟嘟 手机又响了</text><text for="L18">要花多少钱才能换来独处？</text><text for="L19">我该怎么办？又该去哪里？ <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(我该去哪里？)</span></text><text for="L20">再喝一杯我就回家</text><text for="L21">不过吃顿饭罢了 不会压垮我的灵魂</text><text for="L22">一只迪奥包 我又怎能拒绝？ <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(我怎能拒绝？)</span></text><text for="L23">我们都孤单地留在东京</text><text for="L24">霓虹照不亮前路</text><text for="L25">伸出手渴望一线希望</text><text for="L26">却无处可去</text><text for="L27">孤身一人在东京</text><text for="L28">黑西装们要花钱买爱</text><text for="L29">他们付出的永远不够</text><text for="L30">没有哪儿比得上家</text><text for="L31">于是我起舞</text><text for="L32">在舞台上对着口型</text><text for="L33">唱着他们写好的词</text><text for="L34">困在一座金色牢笼</text><text for="L35">我摆出姿态</text><text for="L36">半裸着登上封面 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(封面)</span></text><text for="L37">被修饰得前所未有 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(旁人)</span></text><text for="L38">我受人爱慕 却没有爱人 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(爱人)</span></text><text for="L39">嘟嘟嘟 手机又响了</text><text for="L40">他们为何不肯放过我？</text><text for="L41">我做过什么？又去了哪里？ <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(我去了哪里？)</span></text><text for="L42">把我打扮得像个娃娃</text><text for="L43">可他们根本不了解我</text><text for="L44">是时候站起来说不</text><text for="L45">我们都孤单地留在东京</text><text for="L46">霓虹照不亮前路</text><text for="L47">伸出手渴望一线希望</text><text for="L48">却无处可去</text><text for="L49">我们都孤单地留在东京</text><text for="L50">黑西装们要花钱买爱</text><text for="L51">他们付出的永远不够</text><text for="L52">没有哪儿比得上家</text><text for="L53">金钱解不开我的困境 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(困境)</span></text><text for="L54">金钱也无法带来改变 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(没有改变)</span></text><text for="L55">他们买我的唱片只为握一握我的手</text><text for="L56">却连我的名字都不知道</text><text for="L57">他们从不许我抱怨 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(抱怨)</span></text><text for="L58">满脑子想的只有我的身体 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(脑海)</span></text><text for="L59">我不需要华服美鞋和戒指</text><text for="L60">也能做自己 走自己的路</text><text for="L61">我们都孤单地留在东京</text><text for="L62">霓虹照不亮前路</text><text for="L63">伸出手渴望一线希望</text><text for="L64">却无处可去</text><text for="L65">我们都孤单地留在东京</text><text for="L66">黑西装们要花钱买爱</text><text for="L67">他们付出的永远不够</text><text for="L68">没有哪儿比得上家</text><text for="L69">独自漂泊在东京</text><text for="L70">Oh</text><text for="L71">Oh</text><text for="L72">孤身一人在东京</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="3:13.385"><div begin="0:02.523" end="3:13.385"><p begin="0:02.523" end="0:04.413" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:02.523" end="0:03.003">Lone</span><span begin="0:03.003" end="0:03.493">ly</span> <span begin="0:03.493" end="0:03.693">in</span> <span begin="0:03.693" end="0:03.973">To</span><span begin="0:03.973" end="0:04.413">kyo</span></p><p begin="0:04.883" end="0:06.913" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:04.883" end="0:05.413">Ne</span><span begin="0:05.413" end="0:05.763">on</span> <span begin="0:05.763" end="0:06.083">can't</span> <span begin="0:06.083" end="0:06.353">light</span> <span begin="0:06.353" end="0:06.533">the</span> <span begin="0:06.533" end="0:06.913">road</span></p><p begin="0:07.198" end="0:09.168" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:07.198" end="0:07.778">Reach</span> <span begin="0:07.778" end="0:08.218">out</span> <span begin="0:08.218" end="0:08.448">in</span> <span begin="0:08.448" end="0:08.768">need</span> <span begin="0:08.768" end="0:08.888">of</span> <span begin="0:08.888" end="0:09.168">hope</span></p><p begin="0:10.342" end="0:11.572" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:10.342" end="0:10.502">With</span> <span begin="0:10.502" end="0:10.772">no</span><span begin="0:10.772" e