.313">ta</span><span begin="0:25.313" end="0:25.563">ble</span></p><p begin="0:25.948" end="0:28.038" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:25.948" end="0:25.988">I</span> <span begin="0:25.988" end="0:26.298">know</span> <span begin="0:26.298" end="0:26.588">my</span> <span begin="0:26.588" end="0:26.978">mom's</span> <span begin="0:26.978" end="0:27.228">out</span> <span begin="0:27.228" end="0:27.578">was</span><span begin="0:27.578" end="0:28.038">ted</span></p><p begin="0:28.276" end="0:30.156" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:28.276" end="0:28.876">So</span> <span begin="0:28.876" end="0:29.156">un</span><span begin="0:29.156" end="0:29.516">sta</span><span begin="0:29.516" end="0:30.156">ble</span></p><p begin="0:30.160" end="0:32.290" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:30.160" end="0:30.370">When</span> <span begin="0:30.370" end="0:30.700">I</span> <span begin="0:30.700" end="0:32.290">go</span></p><p begin="0:32.755" end="0:35.645" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:32.755" end="0:32.935">To</span> <span begin="0:32.935" end="0:33.045">the</span> <span begin="0:33.045" end="0:33.695">24-</span><span begin="0:33.695" end="0:34.155">hour</span> <span begin="0:34.155" end="0:34.845">store</span> <span ttm:role="x-bg"><span begin="0:34.838" end="0:35.410">(Store)</span></span></p><p begin="0:35.471" end="0:37.841" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:35.471" end="0:35.631">Ev</span><span begin="0:35.631" end="0:35.711">ery</span><span begin="0:35.711" end="0:35.951">thing</span> <span begin="0:35.951" end="0:36.311">taste</span> <span begin="0:36.311" end="0:36.451">so</span> <span begin="0:36.451" end="0:37.061">plas</span><span begin="0:37.061" end="0:37.521">tic</span> <span ttm:role="x-bg"><span begin="0:37.136" end="0:37.603">(Plas</span><span begin="0:37.603" end="0:37.883">tic)</span></span></p><p begin="0:37.801" end="0:39.481" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:37.801" end="0:37.941">I</span> <span begin="0:37.941" end="0:38.071">don't</span> <span begin="0:38.071" end="0:38.221">wan</span><span begin="0:38.221" end="0:38.341">na</span> <span begin="0:38.341" end="0:38.591">eat</span> <span begin="0:38.591" end="0:38.861">no</span> <span begin="0:38.861" end="0:39.481">more</span></p><p begin="0:40.139" end="0:42.419" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:40.139" end="0:40.409">Beep,</span> <span begin="0:40.409" end="0:40.699">beep,</span> <span begin="0:40.699" end="0:40.989">beep,</span> <span begin="0:40.989" end="0:41.219">there</span> <span begin="0:41.219" end="0:41.559">goes</span> <span begin="0:41.559" end="0:41.729">my</span> <span begin="0:41.729" end="0:42.419">phone</span></p><p begin="0:42.748" end="0:44.768" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:42.748" end="0:42.938">How</span> <span begin="0:42.938" end="0:43.308">much</span> <span begin="0:43.308" end="0:43.528">to</span> <span begin="0:43.528" end="0:43.908">be</span> <span begin="0:43.908" end="0:44.068">a</span><span begin="0:44.068" end="0:44.768">lone?</span></p><p begin="0:45.122" end="0:48.822" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:45.122" end="0:45.372">What</span> <span begin="0:45.372" end="0:45.602">do</span> <span begin="0:45.602" end="0:45.762">I</span> <span begin="0:45.762" end="0:46.202">do?</span> <span begin="0:46.202" end="0:46.502">Where</span> <span begin="0:46.502" end="0:46.742">do</span> <span begin="0:46.742" end="0:46.922">I</span> <span begin="0:46.922" end="0:48.822">go?</span><span ttm:role="x-bg"><span begin="0:47.407" end="0:47.717">(Where</span> <span begin="0:47.717" end="0:47.905">do</span> <span begin="0:47.905" end="0:48.120">I</span> <span begin="0:48.120" end="0:49.204">go?)</span></span></p><p begin="0:49.550" end="0:51.670" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:49.550" end="0:49.740">One</span> <span begin="0:49.740" end="0:49.990">more</span> <span begin="0:49.990" end="0:50.400">drink</span> <span b